                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="were starving. At last Lieutenant Kekurov, with three hundred men, sallied"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l4" HPOS="422" VPOS="638" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="424 683 2192 677" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="424 683 424 700 2190 695 2192 677 2186 642 1851 648 1824 638 1822 638 1820 638 1736 648 1681 638 1679 638 1677 638 1676 638 1660 648 1543 640 1541 640 1539 640 1537 640 1522 652 1391 652 1364 640 1362 640 1360 640 1260 650 1225 640 1223 640 1221 640 1219 640 1194 650 1126 640 1124 640 943 652 910 642 908 642 906 642 904 642 902 642 888 652 837 642 836 642 834 642 798 652 765 642 763 642 761 642 760 642 736 652 722 642 721 642 719 642 572 642 570 642 569 642 539 652 436 642 434 642 432 642 430 642 422 648 424 683"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="forth through the besieging multitude, and secured provisions from a successful"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l5" HPOS="420" VPOS="700" WIDTH="312" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="422 737 732 743" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="422 737 420 753 728 759 732 743 732 714 705 702 703 702 701 702 645 712 633 702 633 700 631 700 629 700 627 700 422 706 422 737"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="reindeer-hunt."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l6" HPOS="530" VPOS="759" WIDTH="1662" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="531 802 2192 798" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="531 802 531 817 2190 813 2192 798 2190 771 2147 759 2145 759 2143 759 2141 759 2112 769 2065 759 2063 759 1995 769 1948 759 1946 759 1944 759 1913 771 1679 771 1664 759 1662 759 1660 759 1658 759 1545 769 1523 759 1522 759 1520 759 1428 769 1290 761 1288 761 1286 761 1256 771 1097 761 1095 761 1093 761 1062 771 1005 761 1003 761 913 771 863 761 861 761 530 767 531 802"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Further details of the first expedition of Pavlutsky are contained in the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l7" HPOS="420" VPOS="817" WIDTH="1772" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="422 866 2192 856" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="422 866 422 880 2190 870 2192 856 2188 829 2036 829 2009 817 2007 817 2005 817 2003 817 2001 817 1985 829 1880 829 1855 817 1853 817 1851 817 1849 817 1847 817 1828 829 1802 819 1800 819 1798 819 1584 829 1520 819 1518 819 1444 831 1424 821 1422 821 1420 821 1418 821 1385 831 1085 823 1083 823 1025 833 871 823 869 823 867 823 839 833 691 825 689 825 687 825 685 825 674 835 660 825 658 825 656 825 654 825 594 835 440 827 438 827 436 827 434 827 420 833 422 866"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="report of eleven of its members, presented to Lieut-Col. Plenisner, the com-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l8" HPOS="426" VPOS="889" WIDTH="1764" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="426 923 2190 923" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="426 923 426 936 2188 944 2190 923 2188 889 426 889 426 923"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="mandant of Okhotsk in the year 1763.¹ They vary slightly from the preceding"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l9" HPOS="422" VPOS="940" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="424 983 2190 975" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="424 983 424 999 2188 997 2190 975 2186 940 1370 940 1368 940 1301 950 908 942 906 942 904 942 861 952 584 944 582 944 422 954 424 983"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="account as to the number of soldiers and the dates of battles; and I should"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l10" HPOS="422" VPOS="1000" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="424 1043 2192 1038" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="424 1043 424 1057 2190 1053 2192 1038 2188 1010 1646 1000 1644 1000 1596 1010 1099 1002 1097 1002 976 1012 518 1004 516 1004 422 1014 424 1043"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="consider them quite trustworthy were it not for the fact that the report was"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l11" HPOS="424" VPOS="1063" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="426 1106 2192 1100" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="426 1106 426 1119 2188 1121 2192 1100 2188 1071 1015 1063 1013 1063 1011 1063 978 1073 483 1065 481 1065 424 1075 426 1106"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="written thirty-two years after the events described. According to that report,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l12" HPOS="426" VPOS="1117" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="428 1164 2194 1156" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1164 428 1180 2192 1172 2194 1156 2190 1129 2020 1117 2019 1117 1935 1127 1909 1117 1907 1117 1905 1117 1831 1127 1773 1117 1771 1117 1769 1117 1767 1117 1748 1129 1716 1119 1714 1119 1713 1119 1483 1129 1447 1119 1446 1119 1444 1119 1442 1119 1407 1129 1311 1119 1309 1119 1307 1119 1305 1119 1286 1131 1218 1121 1216 1121 1214 1121 1175 1133 1065 1133 1048 1121 1046 1121 1044 1121 1042 1121 837 1135 683 1135 668 1123 666 1123 664 1123 662 1123 426 1129 428 1164"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Pavlutsky’s party was made up of 236 Russians, and 280 Koryak and Yuka-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l13" HPOS="426" VPOS="1178" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="68" BASELINE="428 1229 2194 1221" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1229 428 1246 1352 1234 1734 1242 1736 1242 1845 1232 2190 1240 2194 1221 2192 1191 2161 1178 2159 1178 2157 1178 2155 1178 2128 1190 2028 1178 2026 1178 2024 1178 2022 1178 2005 1191 1853 1191 1822 1178 1820 1178 1818 1178 1748 1191 1494 1180 1492 1180 1490 1180 1453 1191 1399 1180 1397 1180 1395 1180 1393 1180 1375 1193 1196 1193 1163 1182 1161 1182 1159 1182 1157 1182 1112 1193 1058 1182 1056 1182 1054 1182 1052 1182 1034 1195 867 1195 841 1186 839 1186 837 1186 717 1195 596 1184 594 1184 531 1195 461 1184 459 1184 457 1184 426 1195 428 1229"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="ghir. They went across the desert to the Arctic Sea, and on reaching it,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l14" HPOS="426" VPOS="1238" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="428 1285 2196 1279" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1285 428 1299 2194 1293 2196 1279 2192 1250 2126 1238 2124 1238 2122 1238 2096 1248 2083 1238 2081 1238 2079 1238 2077 1238 1915 1248 1855 1238 1853 1238 1851 1238 1829 1248 1765 1238 1763 1238 1761 1238 1720 1248 1648 1238 1646 1238 1644 1238 1601 1250 1179 1240 1177 1240 1175 1240 1173 1240 1157 1252 1067 1252 1017 1240 1015 1240 1013 1240 980 1252 947 1242 945 1242 943 1242 941 1242 900 1252 682 1242 680 1242 594 1252 537 1242 535 1242 426 1254 428 1285"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="turned to the east. On May 9 they found a house of the Maritime Chukchee"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l15" HPOS="426" VPOS="1303" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="428 1343 2194 1340" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1343 428 1357 2190 1363 2194 1340 2190 1310 498 1303 496 1303 426 1312 428 1343"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="and murdered all the people. Shortly afterwards they found another house,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l16" HPOS="426" VPOS="1357" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="428 1404 2192 1396" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1404 428 1419 2190 1419 2192 1396 2188 1369 1972 1369 1941 1357 1939 1357 1937 1357 1867 1367 1810 1357 1808 1357 1748 1369 1724 1359 1722 1359 1720 1359 1566 1369 1539 1359 1537 1359 1535 1359 1533 1359 1531 1359 1518 1369 1469 1359 1467 1359 1465 1359 1446 1369 1366 1359 1364 1359 1301 1371 1268 1361 1266 1361 1264 1361 1126 1371 984 1361 982 1361 980 1361 958 1371 869 1361 867 1361 668 1373 496 1363 494 1363 426 1375 428 1404"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="and also murdered its inmates. Then they had a battle with a large party"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l17" HPOS="426" VPOS="1416" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="64" BASELINE="428 1464 2194 1457" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1464 428 1480 2192 1480 2194 1457 2190 1427 2001 1427 1983 1416 1981 1416 1980 1416 1978 1416 1976 1416 1952 1425 1929 1416 1927 1416 1925 1416 1843 1425 1790 1416 1789 1416 1724 1427 1640 1418 1638 1418 1594 1427 1574 1418 1572 1418 1570 1418 1506 1427 1479 1418 1477 1418 1475 1418 1403 1427 1375 1418 1373 1418 1371 1418 1305 1429 1108 1419 1106 1419 1044 1429 1009 1419 1007 1419 1005 1419 913 1429 884 1419 882 1419 880 1419 878 1419 876 1419 861 1431 849 1421 847 1421 845 1421 843 1421 666 1431 650 1421 648 1421 646 1421 469 1421 467 1421 465 1421 426 1433 428 1464"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of Reindeer Chukchee, in which about four hundred and fifty of the enemy"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l18" HPOS="428" VPOS="1478" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="430 1525 2196 1519" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 1525 430 1538 2194 1534 2196 1519 2194 1490 2157 1478 2155 1478 2153 1478 2151 1478 2114 1488 1995 1478 1993 1478 1991 1478 1989 1478 1972 1490 1833 1490 1810 1478 1808 1478 1806 1478 1693 1488 1619 1478 1617 1478 1615 1478 1574 1490 1545 1480 1543 1480 1541 1480 1490 1490 1140 1480 1138 1480 1069 1490 1038 1480 1036 1480 1034 1480 931 1492 894 1482 892 1482 890 1482 703 1492 687 1482 685 1482 683 1482 563 1482 561 1482 559 1482 557 1482 541 1494 428 1494 430 1525"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="were killed, and a hundred and fifty women and children taken captive. On"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l19" HPOS="426" VPOS="1542" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="428 1583 2196 1579" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="428 1583 428 1599 2194 1595 2196 1579 2192 1550 452 1542 450 1542 448 1542 426 1550 428 1583"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the Russian side two were killed and about seventy wounded, but none severely."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l20" HPOS="428" VPOS="1597" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="430 1644 2194 1636" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 1644 430 1657 2192 1653 2194 1636 2190 1609 2120 1597 2118 1597 1742 1609 1471 1599 1469 1599 1299 1610 1284 1601 1282 1601 1280 1601 1278 1601 1276 1601 1245 1610 1027 1601 1025 1601 962 1610 929 1601 927 1601 925 1601 810 1612 452 1603 450 1603 448 1603 446 1603 428 1610 430 1644"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="After that they found a Chukchee fortress which was constructed of driving-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l21" HPOS="428" VPOS="1663" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="430 1704 2196 1698" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="430 1704 430 1720 2194 1714 2196 1698 2192 1669 457 1663 455 1663 454 1663 428 1673 430 1704"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="sledges and pack-sledges, covered with walrus-hide and strengthened with large"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l22" HPOS="430" VPOS="1731" WIDTH="682" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="432 1763 1112 1759" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="432 1763 432 1778 1110 1776 1112 1759 1106 1731 430 1733 432 1763"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="stones, hummocks, and earth."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l23" HPOS="535" VPOS="1774" WIDTH="1663" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="537 1825 2198 1815" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="537 1825 537 1837 2196 1835 2198 1815 2192 1780 2032 1786 2003 1774 2001 1774 1999 1774 1997 1774 1966 1786 1943 1774 1941 1774 1939 1774 1843 1788 1818 1776 1816 1776 1814 1776 1812 1776 1783 1788 1757 1776 1755 1776 1753 1776 1752 1776 1750 1776 1728 1790 1652 1790 1541 1776 1539 1776 1537 1776 1535 1776 1518 1792 1389 1792 1358 1778 1356 1778 1354 1778 1352 1778 1315 1790 1255 1778 1253 1778 1251 1778 1214 1790 1173 1780 1171 1780 1169 1780 1028 1792 1011 1780 1009 1780 1007 1780 873 1780 871 1780 869 1780 867 1780 849 1794 662 1782 660 1782 658 1782 656 1782 643 1794 627 1782 625 1782 623 1782 559 1782 557 1782 555 1782 553 1782 535 1792 537 1825"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="All this was bound around with thong. They took it and destroyed"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l24" HPOS="430" VPOS="1837" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="432 1885 2198 1877" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="432 1885 432 1897 2196 1891 2198 1877 2194 1848 1822 1837 1820 1837 1716 1848 1488 1839 1486 1839 1485 1839 1444 1848 1414 1839 1412 1839 1410 1839 1409 1839 1377 1848 1165 1840 1163 1840 1161 1840 1159 1840 1143 1852 1011 1852 939 1840 937 1840 935 1840 910 1850 567 1842 565 1842 430 1854 432 1885"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="everything. Inside of it were five houses.² On the 29th of June there was"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l25" HPOS="432" VPOS="1899" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="434 1944 2198 1938" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 1944 434 1955 2196 1953 2198 1938 2196 1911 2159 1899 2157 1899 2155 1899 2153 1899 2118 1909 2083 1899 2081 1899 2079 1899 2077 1899 2040 1911 1835 1911 1802 1899 1800 1899 1798 1899 1796 1899 1761 1909 1638 1899 1637 1899 1635 1899 1605 1911 1023 1901 1021 1901 1019 1901 986 1913 931 1903 929 1903 802 1913 787 1903 785 1903 783 1903 625 1903 623 1903 432 1915 434 1944"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="a second battle. The Chukchee were about one thousand strong, and the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l26" HPOS="432" VPOS="1955" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="434 2004 2198 1994" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2004 434 2018 2196 2012 2198 1994 2194 1967 2042 1955 2040 1955 2038 1955 2007 1965 1976 1955 1974 1955 1972 1955 1909 1965 1886 1955 1884 1955 1882 1955 1880 1955 1839 1967 1580 1957 1578 1957 1488 1969 1428 1959 1426 1959 1424 1959 1397 1969 1295 1959 1294 1959 1134 1971 1030 1961 1028 1961 970 1971 795 1961 793 1961 791 1961 754 1973 732 1963 730 1963 728 1963 641 1973 625 1963 623 1963 621 1963 619 1963 617 1963 578 1973 547 1963 545 1963 543 1963 432 1967 434 2004"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="battle lasted from morning until dinner-time. About three hundred were"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l27" HPOS="432" VPOS="2018" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="68" BASELINE="434 2065 2200 2057" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2065 434 2076 793 2086 795 2086 910 2074 1202 2084 1204 2084 1381 2072 1479 2082 1481 2082 1535 2072 1562 2082 1564 2082 1566 2084 1728 2084 1728 2082 1730 2082 1759 2070 1837 2080 1839 2080 1841 2080 1843 2080 1857 2070 1929 2080 1931 2080 1933 2080 1935 2080 1948 2070 1978 2080 1980 2080 1981 2080 2198 2070 2200 2057 2196 2029 1884 2018 1882 2018 1880 2018 1847 2028 1802 2018 1800 2018 1798 2018 1755 2029 1722 2020 1720 2020 1718 2020 1672 2029 1455 2020 1453 2020 1391 2029 1317 2020 1315 2020 1313 2020 1311 2020 1295 2031 1237 2022 1235 2022 1097 2031 432 2029 434 2065"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="killed, but only ten were captured. All others escaped. At the same time"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l28" HPOS="432" VPOS="2088" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="434 2123 2198 2117" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2123 434 2137 2196 2135 2198 2117 2194 2088 432 2088 434 2123"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="large herds of reindeer were captured; in all, about forty thousand heads. In"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l29" HPOS="430" VPOS="2137" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="432 2183 2200 2178" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="432 2183 432 2197 2198 2193 2200 2178 2196 2148 2112 2137 2110 2137 2108 2137 2081 2146 2032 2137 2030 2137 1911 2146 1880 2137 1878 2137 1876 2137 1781 2146 1753 2137 1752 2137 1750 2137 1748 2137 1746 2137 1728 2148 1601 2148 1559 2139 1557 2139 1555 2139 1553 2139 1525 2148 1251 2139 1249 2139 1247 2139 1245 2139 1231 2148 1204 2139 1202 2139 1200 2139 1198 2139 1167 2148 1042 2139 1040 2139 1038 2139 1036 2139 1017 2150 966 2141 964 2141 758 2150 740 2141 738 2141 736 2141 514 2141 512 2141 430 2152 432 2183"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="a third battle about five hundred Chukchee took part, about forty of whom"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l30" HPOS="432" VPOS="2195" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="434 2242 2198 2234" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2242 434 2256 2194 2258 2198 2234 2194 2207 1902 2195 1900 2195 1847 2205 1820 2195 1818 2195 1816 2195 1752 2207 1508 2197 1506 2197 1447 2207 1395 2197 1393 2197 1334 2207 1319 2197 1317 2197 1315 2197 1313 2197 1311 2197 1272 2211 1075 2211 1042 2199 1040 2199 1038 2199 972 2209 921 2199 919 2199 917 2199 915 2199 900 2209 876 2199 874 2199 873 2199 871 2199 832 2211 806 2201 804 2201 802 2201 703 2211 687 2201 685 2201 683 2201 567 2201 565 2201 563 2201 561 2201 545 2213 432 2213 434 2242"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="were killed, and all the others escaped. One Cossack was also killed. They"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-161_l31" HPOS="432" VPOS="2258" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="434 2302 2202 2295" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="434 2302 434 2316 2200 2312 2202 2295 2198 2269 2116 2258 2114 2258 2112 2258 2110 2258 2093 2269 1896 2269 1839 2258 1837 2258 1835 2258 1798 2267 1761 2258 1759 2258 1757 2258 1755 2258 1753 2258 1732 2269 1420 2259 1418 2259 1416 2259 1389 2269 1270 2261 1268 2261 1266 2261 1264 2261 1249 2271 1050 2261 1048 2261 1046 2261 1007 2271 962 2261 960 2261 958 2261 939 2271 876 2261 874 2261 432 2275 434 2302"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="came to the Anadyr in the first days of November. In the summer-time"/>
                    </TextLine>

